     "ex": "elevator pitch (30 s)\n\"Finance teams in the Gulf still type supplier invoices by hand. I built a system that reads the PDF,\n extracts the fields with Claude, lets a person approve in Slack, and posts to Odoo — safely, with no lost\n invoices. For my client it cut entry time from 6 minutes to 24 seconds and saves about $17,000 a year.\"\n\ndemo script\n0:00 problem: a pile of 30 PDFs · 1:00 upload → Slack card in 20 s · 2:30 approve → Odoo entry appears\n4:00 duplicate upload → ignored · 5:00 architecture + ADR «queue before Odoo» · 7:00 numbers · 9:00 next",
